{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03978","headline":"晦日置酒林亭 · 高正臣","name":"晦日置酒林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正月符嘉节，三春翫物华。\n忘怀寄尊酒，陶性狎山家。\n柳翠含烟叶，梅芳带雪花。\n光阴不相借，迟迟落景斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高正臣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}